<task id="020" project="spaarke-side-pane-navigation-history-r1">
  <metadata>
    <title>sprk_navitem schema authoring — entity-schema.md + Deploy-SprkNavItemEntity.ps1</title>
    <phase>2 Entity</phase>
    <gate>blocked</gate>
    <status>completed</status>
    <rigor>STANDARD</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>New-file authoring (Dataverse entity-schema doc + PowerShell deploy script); no .ts/.tsx code, no BFF/pcf/plugin. The actual environment mutation is a separate task (021).</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Well-specified schema authoring mirroring an existing exemplar (sprk_todo) with a closed acceptance set; no root-cause/brownfield judgment.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>A</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Group A runs alongside task 010 (widen xrmContext.ts) — different surfaces (Dataverse schema authoring vs shared-lib TS typings), no shared files.</parallel-reason>
